        "chapterIds": [
          "PRO.1"
        ],
        "reference": "Proverbs 1:7-12",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Fear of YHWH [is the] beginning of knowledge, || Fools have despised wisdom and instruction! ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.7",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.7"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Hear, my son, the instruction of your father, || And do not leave the law of your mother, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.8",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.8"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For they [are] a graceful wreath to your head, || And chains to your neck. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.9"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "My son, if sinners entice you, do not be willing. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.10",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.10"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "If they say, “Come with us, we lay wait for blood, || We watch secretly for the innocent without cause, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.11",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.11"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "We swallow them as Sheol—alive, || And whole—as those going down [to] the pit, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PRO.1.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PRO.1.12"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
